<p>Decimal 36879. Raw name for this VIC chip register. Also known as <strong>SCREEN_BG_COLOR</strong>, where the full description lives.</p>
<p>Background colour, border colour and the inverse colour switch.</p>
<ul>
<li>Bits 7-4 - background colour (0-15)</li>
<li>Bit 3 - inverse colour switch, 1 is normal video</li>
<li>Bits 2-0 - border colour (0-7)</li>
</ul>
<p>Set it with the SCREEN_BG_ constants plus a border colour, for example
<strong>SCREEN_BG_BLACK + CYAN</strong>.</p>
